        "created_at": "2020-03-04T03:54:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I really enjoyed this one! I like Naturalist as a character, but he sometimes feels quite disconnected from the rest of the Sentinels ‘verse, so having these characters around him really helps flesh out his life and his story.</p>\n<p>I really love all the Secret Identity drama, with people knowing or eventually learning the secret...good stuff, and something we don’t get much of in Sentinels.</p>",
